        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>去过6次重庆 深度解锁千里江山 行程表</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    background: #fdf3d9;\n    color: #222;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 580px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fdf3d9;\n    padding: 0 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Header ---------- */\n  .header {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 10px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .header .line1 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .header .line1 .num { color: #e01f1f; font-size: 30px; }\n  .header .line1 .red { color: #e01f1f; font-size: 30px; }\n  .header .line1 .black { color: #111; }\n  .header .line2 {\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #e01f1f;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Table ---------- */\n  table.trip {\n    width: 96%;\n    margin: 8px auto 0 auto;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    background: #fdf3d9;\n  }\n  table.trip th, table.trip td {\n    border: 1px solid #7a6a3a;\n    padding: 6px 6px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  table.trip thead th {\n    background: #f3d98b;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 6px 0;\n  }\n  .col-time { width: 62px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; }\n  .col-eat { width: 34px; text-align: center; }\n  .route { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.9; }\n  .small { font-size: 10px; color: #555; }\n  .sun { color: #f0a500; }\n  .leaf { color: #2e8b2e; }\n  .day4-cell { vertical-align: top; }\n  /* Day4 left column */\n  .day4-time {\n    text-align: center;\n    vertical-align: top;\n    padding-top: 120px !important;\n  }\n  .day4-badge {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #e01f1f;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    padding: 6px 4px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n  }\n  .day4-note {\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  /* Day4 content */\n  .day4-head {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .sec-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 8px 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  .sec-title.red { color: #e01f1f; font-size: 15px; }\n  .sec-title.black { font-size: 14px; }\n  .sec-title.orange { color: #e06a00; font-size: 14px; }\n  .sec-title.green { color: #1f7a1f; font-size: 14px; }\n  .centered { text-align: center; }\n  .info-line { text-align: center; font-size: 12.5px; }\n  .clock { color: #e01f1f; }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"line1\"><span class=\"black\">去过</span><span class=\"num\">6次</span><span class=\"red\">重庆</span> <span class=\"black\" style=\"font-size:24px;\">深度解锁千里江山</span></div>\n    <div class=\"line2\">3D魔幻网红打卡+小众人文建筑+地道小吃</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <table class=\"trip\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"col-time\">时间</th>\n        <th>线路</th>\n        <th class=\"col-eat\">吃</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"col-time\">第1天</td>\n        <td class=\"route\">\n          <span class=\"sun\">☀</span> 三峡博物馆（重庆大礼堂）→解放碑→八一好吃街→能仁寺→左营天桥→<br>\n          <span class=\"leaf\">🌿</span> 罗汉寺·摩崖石刻→朝天门→<span class=\"sun\">☀</span> <strong>来福士/WFC观景台</strong>（2选1）→魁星楼→<span class=\"leaf\">🌿</span> 洪崖洞·夜景→<span class=\"leaf\">🌿</span> 千厮门大桥\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"col-eat\"></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"col-time\">第2天</td>\n        <td class=\"route\">\n          马鞍山堂里→<span class=\"sun\">☀</span> <strong>中山四路文化街区</strong><span class=\"small\">→地铁/打车</span>→<br>\n          李子坝<span class=\"small\">→地铁观音桥</span>→北仓文创园→不夜九街\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"col-eat\"></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"col-time\">第3天</td>\n        <td class=\"route\">\n          <span class=\"sun\">☀</span> <strong>山城第三步道</strong>→十八梯→白象居→<strong>湖广会馆</strong>→东水门城墙→<span class=\"small\">过</span>长江索道/两江衔旧游轮（2选1）→<span class=\"sun\">☀</span> <strong>龙门浩老街</strong>→弹子石老街→南滨游艇广场→南滨路→<span class=\"leaf\">🌿</span> <strong>南山一棵树·夜景</strong>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"col-eat\"></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"col-time day4-time\">\n          <div class=\"day4-badge\">第<br>4<br>天<br>❗</div>\n          <div class=\"day4-note\">可根据情况替换！</div>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"day4-cell\">\n          <div class=\"day4-head\">\n            <span class=\"sun\">☀</span> <strong>渣滓洞白公馆→磁器口古镇→打车马房湾七彩巷→罗中立美术馆→</strong><span class=\"sun\">☀</span> <strong>黄桷坪涂鸦一条街</strong>→交通茶馆→铁路四村\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"sec-title red\">▶渣滓洞白公馆景区</div>\n          <div class=\"info-line\"><span class=\"clock\">🕘</span> 9:00-16:30 网上实名制预约</div>\n          <div class=\"info-line\">烈士墓、渣滓洞、白公馆 往返专线车，每人20元</div>\n\n          <div class=\"sec-title black\">▶渣滓洞</div>\n          <div class=\"centered\">原为人工开采小煤窑，1920年由资本家程尔昌所建，后煤窑被军统所霸占改造成煤坑。</div>\n\n          <div class=\"sec-title black\">▶白公馆</div>\n          <div class=\"centered\">原为四川军阀白驹郊外别墅，因自谓是白居易的后台，<br>1939年军统特务头子戴笠，改造为迫害革命家的监狱。</div>\n\n          <div class=\"sec-title orange\">▶磁器口古镇</div>\n          <div class=\"centered\">商业化严重，但是可以一看<br>\n          重庆非常有名的古镇，感受这座城市历史和古韵，还有各种各样的小吃。</div>\n\n          <div class=\"sec-title orange\">▶马房湾七彩巷（网红打卡）</div>\n          <div class=\"centered\">童话世界中的彩色王国，房子都被涂成了五颜六色，明星涂鸦墙</div>\n\n          <div class=\"sec-title green\">▶罗中立美术馆</div>\n          <div class=\"info-line\"><span class=\"clock\">🕘</span> 9:30-16:30（周一闭馆）免费 微信\"四川美院美术馆\"预约</div>\n          <div class=\"centered\">川美黄角坪校区，面积最大的美术馆，旁边是大学城有名照街</div>\n\n          <div class=\"sec-title orange\">▶黄桷坪涂鸦一条街</div>\n          <div class=\"centered\">川美黄角坪校区，这条街上从楼房、墙面，到校园、店铺等满满的涂鸦</div>\n\n          <div class=\"sec-title black\">▶交通茶馆</div>\n          <div class=\"centered\">一杯茶10元 黄桷坪正街与红专路上<br>\n          始于1987年，保持上世纪七八十年代风格，水泥地面、红砖柱头、四方桌、条凳，青花茶碗…嗑茶碰瓜子打麻将搓牌的阵阵。电影《疯狂的石头》取景</div>\n\n          <div class=\"sec-title black\">▶铁路四村</div>\n          <div class=\"centered\">废弃的铁轨上长满了绿色植物，瞬间掉入宫崎骏动画的感觉<br>\n          有一家军哥书屋的二手书店。</div>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"col-eat\"></td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
